1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:00,673
Keep your eyes

2
00:00:00,673 --> 00:00:02,048
on the cross.

3
00:00:02,070 --> 00:00:03,140
See a GREEN dot

4
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:04,237
running round?

5
00:00:04,237 --> 00:00:05,235
There's no green

6
00:00:05,235 --> 00:00:06,760
on your screen.

7
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:08,644
Your eye's faking it.

8
00:00:08,644 --> 00:00:09,830
Keep staring.

9
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:11,000
Don't blink...

10
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,480
The pink dots...

11
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:13,533
fade away.

12
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:14,975
Your eye's sick of pink.

13
00:00:14,975 --> 00:00:16,480
A dot blinks off...

14
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:17,720
you see the opposite.

15
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:18,633
GREEN.

16
00:00:18,667 --> 00:00:19,612
And blurry things

17
00:00:19,612 --> 00:00:21,030
that never change?

18
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:22,360
Your brain just...

19
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:23,800
paints over them.

20
00:00:23,845 --> 00:00:25,000
A scientist once

21
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,429
suction-cupped a picture

22
00:00:26,429 --> 00:00:28,330
onto people's eyeballs.

23
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:29,079
Gone...

24
00:00:29,079 --> 00:00:30,433
in seconds.

25
00:00:30,504 --> 00:00:31,272
So blink.

26
00:00:31,272 --> 00:00:32,670
They're back.

27
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:33,896
Now...

